  (etichetta: [When to Use It], corpo: [
#testo-box[At the first follow\-up visit in the aligner sequence, usually after about two months, when a progressive, generalized loss of tracking appears. Also assess the treatment plan and biological response before attributing it to adherence.]
  ]),
  (etichetta: [Goal], corpo: [
#testo-box[Restore tracking by changing the patient’s behavior or the aligner change interval, then assessing the response.]
  ]),
