#passi-reset()
#passo[Review the patient’s day: meals, work, evenings, weekends, and how long they wait before putting their aligners back in.]
#passo[If the patient confirms that they are wearing them as prescribed, also consider a slower biological response.]
#passo[Discuss moving from seven to twenty\-one days per aligner, explaining that this would significantly slow treatment. Twenty\-one days is a choice in the protocol described here, not a universal prescription.]
#passo[If the patient acknowledges that they have not worn the aligners enough, agree on the prescribed hours of wear and keep the weekly changes when clinical conditions allow.]
#passo[If the patient confirms that they are wearing the aligners as prescribed, slow down the changes and reassess tracking, then decide whether to maintain that pace or speed up.]
