  (lettera: "D", nome: [Dominance], corpo: [
#leva[Main motivators: control and a concrete consequence.]

With a Dominance\-style patient, it is best to communicate directly and briefly, focusing on the decision and avoiding lengthy explanations they might see as a waste of time.

#battuta-disc[#emph[“We can start over, but from now on we’ll use a clear criterion: the next scan must show significant improvement. If treatment has made real progress, we’ll complete the remaining movements as usual. If there’s no substantial progress, another set cannot be considered a normal refinement included in treatment and will carry an additional cost.”];]
  ]),
  (lettera: "I", nome: [Influence], corpo: [
