With an Influence\-style patient, it helps to keep the tone positive and engaging without letting enthusiasm for a new promise take the place of a commitment we can verify.

#battuta-disc[#emph[“This really could be the set that gets your treatment back on track. At the next scan, though, we’ll need to see significant improvement, because the result will tell us whether you followed the plan adequately this time. If treatment has made real progress, we can complete it as usual. If we don’t see substantial progress, another set cannot be considered a normal refinement included in treatment and will carry an additional cost.”];]
  ]),
  (lettera: "S", nome: [Steadiness], corpo: [
#leva[Main motivators: reassurance and clarity.]

With a Steadiness\-style patient, we should avoid making the rule feel like a threat. Explain it calmly and emphasize that its purpose is to help bring treatment to an orderly conclusion.

#battuta-disc[#emph[“I understand these past few months have been difficult, and we can start over without turning this appointment into a reprimand. But I want to explain clearly what will happen: we’ll compare the next scan with today’s, and we’ll need to see significant improvement. If treatment is making real progress, we can complete it as usual. If the improvement isn’t sufficient, we’ll need to decide together how to proceed and discuss any cost for the new phase before starting over again.”];]
  ]),
