With a Conscientiousness\-style patient, it helps to explain precisely that the comparison concerns the overall result and does not require every movement to match the digital treatment setup perfectly.

#battuta-disc[#emph[“We won’t make the comparison by evaluating a single tooth. We’ll look at overall progress relative to the planned movements. We don’t expect a perfect match with the digital treatment setup, because some movements may not be fully achieved even when the aligners are worn as prescribed. There must, however, be clinically significant improvement consistent with adequate adherence. Without that progress, the next phase cannot be considered a normal refinement included in treatment.”];]
  ]),
))

