With a #strong[C]; patient, I use more analytical, verifiable criteria: “We’ve reviewed the initial goals and the clinical parameters we established. The detail you’re seeing is real, and we can define it precisely, but the expected benefit of another refinement is limited. We can therefore consider together whether continuing really makes sense.”
  ]),
))

